  "notes": "NOTES\nKey of C, no capo. Index finger anchors B string 1st fret nearly all song.\nF/A = x03210 (Fmaj7/A). Two fingers move from C, index stays, open e rings.\nC/E = 032010, your C chord plus open low E. Not a new shape.\nDm = Dm7 xx0211, keeps the anchor.\nF barre never needed. F/A or Fmaj7 xx3210 covers it.\nIntro C to Csus is one finger, D string 2nd to 3rd fret.\nG is the only anchor-lift. Lean into it, it is the motion moment.\n",
